<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores in</p>
<p>four-day Supersport Series cricket matches on Friday:</p>
<p>Second day</p>
<p>Cape Town: Boland 239. Western Province 336-5 (S.Koenig 119,</p>
<p>H.Ackerman 65, J.Commins 53 not out).</p>
<p>First day</p>
<p>Pretoria: Free State 349-8 (L.Wilkinson 87, K.Venter 76) v</p>
<p>Northern Transvaal.</p>
<p>East London: Border 261 (Mark Boucher 51). Eastern Province</p>
<p>6-0.</p>
<p>Kimberley: Transvaal 260-3 (A.Bacher 121 not out, N.McKenzie</p>
<p>84) v Griqualand West.</p>
</text>
